    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32427" root="غمس" body-key="g">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَمَسٌ</span></b> , [like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَفَضٌ</span> in the sense of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَنْفُوضٌ</span>, &amp;c.,
or perhaps a mistranscription for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَمْسٌ</span>, like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَرْسٌ</span>
in the sense of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَغْرُوسٌ</span>, and many other instances,]
<i>Immersed, immerged, dipped, plunged,</i> or <i>sunk.</i>
(TA.)

